            "description": {
              "content": "Fetches cluster configuration from the management server. The Cluster Discovery Service (CDS) returns a set of dynamically discovered upstream clusters that Envoy should route traffic to. Each cluster defines how Envoy connects to a group of upstream hosts including load balancing policy, connection limits, circuit breaking thresholds, and health checking configuration.",
